==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|swëben}}, from {{inh|de|goh|swebēn}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*swibāną||to move}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*ksweybʰ-||to twist, turn around}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈʃveːbn̩/}}
* {{audio|de|De-schweben.ogg|Audio}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb|<haben,sein>}}

# {{lb|de|intransitive|auxiliary {{m|de|haben}}}} to [[hover]], to [[float]] (with no implied movement)
# {{lb|de|intransitive|auxiliary {{m|de|sein}}}} to [[float]], to [[drift]] (from one place to another)
# to [[soar]]

====Conjugation====
{{de-conj|<sein>}}

